# Newly generated research artifacts stay opt-in. The user-authorized September 9
# snapshot explicitly tracks existing data, models, runs, and policy packages.
# Downloaded SDKs and regenerable live_scene feeds are not snapshot artifacts.
# Local measurements and fitted artifacts are distributed separately unless approved.
# This does not untrack existing files or remove Git history.
/data/**
!/data/README.md
!/data/dataset_manifest.json

